      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To resolve the \"Error 404: Connectivity Lost\" message on your Zenith SmartHub, try the following steps:\n\n1. Restart your router and modem to ensure a fresh connection.\n2. Check your internet service provider's (ISP) status to ensure outages in your area are not causing the issue.\n3. Verify that your SmartHub is properly connected to your router using an Ethernet cable.\n\nThese steps should help you quickly identify and resolve the connectivity issue.",
